            <div type="edition" xml:lang="tam-Latn" rendition="class:tamil maturity:vernacular">
                
                <p>
                    <lb n="1"/><hi rend="grantha">svasti śrī</hi> <g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g> <hi rend="grantha">tribhu</hi>vanaca<hi rend="grantha">kra</hi>vatti konerimaikoṇṭāṉ <hi rend="grantha">ja</hi>yaṅkoṇṭa coḻavaḷanāṭṭu Ākkūrnāṭṭu <hi rend="grantha">brahma</hi>teyam tirukkaṭa<unclear>vūr Uṭai</unclear>yār tirumayāṉamuṭaiyār koyil tevarkaṉmikkum <hi rend="grantha">śrī</hi>mā<hi rend="grantha">heśva</hi>rak kaṇkāṇi ceyvārkaḷukkum <hi rend="grantha">śrī</hi>kāriyañ ceyvāṉukkum Ittevarkku nittaṟpaṭiyākac ceṅkaḻunīrt tiruppaḷittāmam cāttiyaruḷa tiruOṭaiyākavum ceṅkaḻunir Ākkuvārkkuk koṟṟukkum puṭavai mutalukkum veṇṭuvaṉavaiyikkum tevatāṉa Iṟai<supplied reason="omitted">yili</supplied>yiṭa nām nir vārtta nilattukku Ākkūrāṉa <hi rend="grantha">rāje</hi>ntiraciṅkac caruppetimaṅkalattoṭum kūṭṭi Iṟukkiṟa taṇṭalai Erukkilan tiṭṭai Uṭ
                    <lb n="2" break="no"/>paṭṭa nilattu Ittevar tirunāmattukkāṇiyāy Iṭukiṟa nilattukku Ūrk kaṇakkut taṉmapiriyaṉ Eḻuttiṭṭa kaṇakku <gap reason="lost" quantity="7" unit="character"/> raiye Oru māvaraiyum muṉṉiṟai kaṭṭiṉapaṭi tavintu muppattunālāvatu pacāṉmutal tevatāṉa Iṟaiyiliyā <gap reason="lost" quantity="10" unit="character"/> 
                    <lb n="3"/>ḷvari taraccoṉṉom Innilam muppattunālāvatu pacāṉmutal Ittevarkku <unclear>ttevarkku</unclear>t tevatānam <gap reason="lost" quantity="10" unit="character"/> kkoḷka Eḻutiṉāṉ tirumanti
                </p>
                
